@page "/"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@*
    Home.razor
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------
    The home page. This is the only page the brief asked to be fully built
    out, so it carries every marketing section, in this order:

      1. Hero              - what Polypus is, in one screen
      2. Customer strip    - who runs it
      3. Metrics           - four headline numbers
      4. Features          - the capability grid
      5. Process           - how a document travels through the product
      6. Company           - the company that owns Polypus (Axonite)
      7. Testimonials      - five customer quotes
      8. FAQ               - six frequently asked questions
      9. Closing CTA       - book a walkthrough

    Where the content comes from
      Almost nothing is hard-coded here. The copy lives in:
        Models/ProductProfile.cs          product positioning, metrics, documents, integrations
        Models/CompanyProfile.cs          everything about Axonite
        Services/FeatureCatalog.cs        the feature list
        Services/PlanCatalog.cs           pricing
        Services/TestimonialCatalog.cs    the quotes
        Services/FaqCatalog.cs            the questions
      Change the copy there and this page follows. Only layout lives here.

    Where the plans live
      The home page no longer carries a pricing section of its own. /plans is the
      pricing page, and every plan card there links to /contact?plan={id}, which
      Pages/Contact.razor reads to preselect the plan and show a plan summary
      beside the form.

    Render mode
      InteractiveServer, because the FAQ accordion answers to the visitor.
      Everything else is plain markup that renders on the server.
*@

<PageTitle>Polypus - Intelligent document processing and controlled SAP automation</PageTitle>

<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="@ProductProfile.MetaDescription" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Polypus - documents in, clean SAP postings out" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="@ProductProfile.MetaDescription" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://polypus.axonite.io/" />
</HeadContent>

@* ==========================================================================
   1. Hero
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero__inner">
            <div class="hero__copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">@ProductProfile.HeroEyebrow</p>

                <h1 class="display hero__title">@ProductProfile.HeroHeadline</h1>

                <p class="lead hero__lead">@ProductProfile.HeroLead</p>

                @* <p class="muted measure-tight">@ProductProfile.HeroSupporting</p> *@

                <div class="hero__actions">
                    <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">
                        Book a walkthrough
                        <AppIcon Name="arrow-right" Size="18" />
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-7">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Documents Polypus reads today</p>

                    <div class="doc-strip mt-4">
                        @foreach (var docType in ProductProfile.HeroDocumentTypes)
                        {
                            <span>@docType</span>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            @* Decorative product mock, built from CSS so it stays crisp at any zoom. *@
            <div class="console-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="console">
                    <div class="console__chrome">
                        <span class="console__dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
                        <span class="console__title">Polypus &middot; Review queue &middot; Meridian Industrial</span>
                        <span class="console__tag">INV-88421</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="console__body">
                        <div class="console__rail">
                            <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
                            <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="console__doc">
                            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
                        </div>

                        <div class="console__fields">
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <span class="field-row__name">Supplier</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">100482</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">99</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <span class="field-row__name">Invoice no.</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">INV-88421</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">99</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <span class="field-row__name">Document date</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">14.03.2025</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">98</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <span class="field-row__name">PO reference</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">4500012877</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">97</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <span class="field-row__name">Net amount</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">42,180.00</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">99</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row field-row--flag">
                                <span class="field-row__name">Tax code</span>
                                <span class="field-row__value">J1 / V1 ?</span>
                                <span class="field-row__score">74</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="console__verdict">
                                <span><strong>3-way match</strong> passed &middot; tolerance 0.4% of PO value</span>
                                <span class="console__stamp">
                                    <AppIcon Name="check" Size="13" />
                                    Routed to review
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="console-float">
                    <b>71%</b>
                    <span>posted untouched</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   2. Customer strip - text names only, no third-party logos are shipped
   ========================================================================== *@
<div class="logo-strip">
    <div class="container logo-strip__inner">
        <span class="logo-strip__label">Running in production at</span>
        <div class="logo-strip__names">
            @foreach (var customer in ProductProfile.Customers)
            {
                <span>@customer</span>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@* ==========================================================================
   3. Metrics
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="metrics" data-reveal>
            @foreach (var metric in ProductProfile.Metrics)
            {
                <div class="metric">
                    <div class="metric__value">@metric.Value</div>
                    <div class="metric__label">@metric.Label</div>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(metric.Footnote))
                    {
                        <div class="metric__footnote">@metric.Footnote</div>
                    }
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   4. Features
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="container">
        <SectionHeading Eyebrow="Capabilities"
                       Title="From Supplier Documents to Seamless ERP Posting"
                       Description="Polypus is not just a document reader with an ERP button on the side. Extraction, validation, review, and posting work together as one governed pipeline—so your automation remains reliable, traceable, and controlled, even during month-end." />

        <div class="feature-grid mt-7" data-reveal>
            @foreach (var feature in FeatureCatalog.HomeHighlights)
            {
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <span class="card__icon"><AppIcon Name="@feature.Icon" Size="22" /></span>
                    <h3>@feature.Title</h3>
                    <p>@feature.Summary</p>
                    @* <div class="feature-card__meta">@feature.Details.Count controls documented</div> *@
                </article>
            }
        </div>

        <div class="plans__toolbar mt-6">
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/features">
                All Ten capabilities in detail
                <AppIcon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" />
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   5. Process - what actually happens to a document
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section section--paper-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <SectionHeading Eyebrow="How it works"
                       Title="One document, four checkpoints, one posting"
                       Description="Nothing reaches your SAP system until it has passed the controls your finance team configured." />

        <div class="process mt-7" data-reveal>
            @{
                var steps = new[]
                {
                    new ProcessStep("01", "Capture",
                        "Documents arrive from mailboxes, SFTP folders, Ariba queues, scanners or the API. Each file is fingerprinted and de-duplicated on arrival.",
                        "instant"),
                    new ProcessStep("02", "Extract and validate",
                        "Fields are captured at line level with confidence scores, then checked against SAP master data: supplier, PO, tax code, cost centre, tolerances.",
                        "under 12 s median"),
                    new ProcessStep("03", "Review only what needs it",
                        "Anything below your confidence threshold or outside tolerance lands in a queue with the source page beside the fields. Corrections tune the tenant.",
                        "exceptions only"),
                    new ProcessStep("04", "Post with evidence",
                        "Approved documents post through IDoc, BAPI or OData. The source, model version, rule set, reviewer and SAP response are stored against the posting.",
                        "parked or posted")
                };
            }

            @foreach (var step in steps)
            {
                <div class="process__step">
                    <span class="process__num">@step.Number</span>
                    <h3>@step.Title</h3>
                    <p>@step.Summary</p>
                    <span class="process__time">@step.Duration</span>
                </div>
            }
        </div>

        @* <div class="mt-7">
            <p class="eyebrow">Documents Polypus reads today</p>
            <div class="doc-strip mt-4">
                @foreach (var docType in ProductProfile.DocumentTypes)
                {
                    <span>@docType</span>
                }
            </div>
        </div> *@
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   6. Company - the company behind Polypus
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section section--paper-alt" id="company">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="company">
            <div class="company__story">
                <SectionHeading Eyebrow="The company behind Polypus"
                               Title="@CompanyProfile.LegalName"
                               Description="@CompanyProfile.Tagline" />

                @foreach (var paragraph in CompanyProfile.Story)
                {
                    <p class="muted">@paragraph</p>
                }

                <figure class="founder-card mt-4">
                    <blockquote>@CompanyProfile.FounderQuote</blockquote>
                    <figcaption>
                        <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span>
                        <span>
                            <span class="founder__name">@CompanyProfile.FounderName</span>
                            <span class="founder__role">@CompanyProfile.FounderRole</span>
                        </span>
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>

                <div class="plans__toolbar mt-5">
                    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://axonite.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                        More about @CompanyProfile.Name
                        <AppIcon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" />
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <div class="company__facts">
                    @foreach (var fact in CompanyProfile.Facts)
                    {
                        <div class="fact">
                            <div class="fact__value">@fact.Value</div>
                            <div class="fact__label">@fact.Label</div>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>

                <div class="office-list mt-6">
                    @foreach (var office in CompanyProfile.Offices)
                    {
                        <div class="office">
                            <div>
                                <span class="office__city">@office.City</span>
                                <span class="office__country">@office.Country</span>
                            </div>
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(office.Address))
                            {
                                <p class="office__address">@office.Address</p>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(office.Role))
                            {
                                <p class="office__role">@office.Role</p>
                            }
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>

                <div class="aside-panel mt-6">
                    <h4 class="h4">Talk to the team that builds it</h4>
                    <div class="dl">
                        <div>
                            <dt>Sales</dt>
                            <dd><a href="mailto:@CompanyProfile.SalesEmail">@CompanyProfile.SalesEmail</a></dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Support</dt>
                            <dd><a href="mailto:@CompanyProfile.SupportEmail">@CompanyProfile.SupportEmail</a></dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Phone</dt>
                            <dd>@CompanyProfile.Phone</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Hours</dt>
                            <dd>@CompanyProfile.SupportHours</dd>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   7. Testimonials
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section" id="customers">
    <div class="container">
        <SectionHeading Eyebrow="Customers"
                       Title="Teams who stopped re-keying invoices"
                       Description="Five of the finance, shared-services and audit teams running Polypus in production." />

        <div class="quotes mt-7">
            <QuoteCard Testimonial="TestimonialCatalog.Featured" />

            <div class="quote-grid" data-reveal>
                @foreach (var quote in TestimonialCatalog.Others)
                {
                    <QuoteCard Testimonial="quote" />
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs muted mt-5">
            Quotes and company names are illustrative sample content for this template.
            Replace them with approved customer references before publishing.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   8. FAQ
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section section--paper-alt">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
        <SectionHeading Eyebrow="Questions"
                       Title="The things procurement always asks"
                       Align="center" />

        <FaqList Items="FaqCatalog.HomeHighlights" CssClass="mt-7" />

        <div class="plans__toolbar plans__toolbar--center mt-6">
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/help">
                More answers in the Help Center
                <AppIcon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" />
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ==========================================================================
   9. Closing call to action
   ========================================================================== *@
<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta" data-reveal>
            <div>
                <h2 class="h2">Send us a month of invoices. We'll show you the postings.</h2>
                <p>
                    A walkthrough runs on your own documents, not on a demo pack. Bring the
                    supplier layouts that normally break your automation and we will process
                    them live, with your validation rules applied.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="cta__actions">
                <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">
                    Book a walkthrough
                    <AppIcon Name="arrow-right" Size="18" />
                </a>
                @* <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/plans">Choose a plan</a>
                <span class="text-xs">No credit card. Sandbox in 30 days.</span> *@
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
